UID:event-ajeeb-in-wonder-house@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T112054Z
DTSTART:20260710T130000Z
DTEND:20260725T183000Z
SUMMARY:Ajeeb in Wonder House
DESCRIPTION:A story-led experience that follows Ajeeb as he visits a series of unusual homes\, each shaped by a different idea\, form\, or function. As the story unfolds\, children observe how each space reflects a way of living\, then shift into designing a home that suits Ajeeb himself. The activity combines storytelling with creative decision-making\, moving from observation to design.
LOCATION:Ithra - Ithra Tower - Level 4\, Show Tank
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-ajeeb-in-wonder-house.html
END:VEVENT
