SUMMARY:Ithra Summer Camp 2026: A world of homes
DESCRIPTION:In this summer camp\, children discover how environment\, materials and traditions shape the design of living spaces\, and how each home reflects the life and culture of its inhabitants. Through observation\, discussion and hands-on learning\, children learn that &ldquo\;home&rdquo\; is a space for living\, creativity and connection across time. Each day offers opportunities for deeper understanding\, discovery and ongoing creativity. Program goals: Design engaging\, hands-on activities that spark curiosity\, nurture creativity and encourage active learning. Promote collaboration through teamwork and peer interaction. Recognize and support each child&rsquo\;s unique learning journey\, ensuring they feel
LOCATION:Ithra - Children Museum
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-ithra-summer-camp-2026-a-world-of-homes.html
END:VEVENT
