SUMMARY:Virtual to Reality
DESCRIPTION:What begins on a screen doesn&rsquo\;t have to stay there. In this experience\, children explore a virtual space\, then follow clear steps to bring part of it into the real world. Piece by piece\, what was seen on screen becomes something they can build and hold in reality.
